---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Delete Your Flightbook Account',
  description: 'Learn how to delete your Flightbook account and understand our data deletion policy',
  robots: {
    index: true,
    follow: true,
  },
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 mx-auto lg:px-8 lg:py-20 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-8 font-heading">Account Deletion</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p>This page explains how to delete your Flightbook account and what happens to your data when you do.</p>

      <h2>How to Delete Your Account</h2>

      <p>You can delete your Flightbook account directly from within the mobile app by following these steps:</p>

      <ol>
        <li>Open the Flightbook mobile app</li>
        <li>Navigate to <strong>Account</strong></li>
        <li>Select <strong>Account Data</strong></li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Delete Account</strong></li>
        <li>Confirm your deletion request</li>
      </ol>

      <p>Alternatively, you can access the account settings directly:</p>

      <p class="my-6">
        <a
          href="https://m.flightbook.ch/settings"
          class="inline-block px-6 py-3 text-white bg-primary rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors font-semibold"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Go to Account Settings
        </a>
      </p>

      <h2>What Happens When You Delete Your Account</h2>

      <h3>Immediate Account Deactivation</h3>

      <p>When you confirm account deletion, your account is <strong>immediately deactivated</strong>:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>You will no longer be able to log in or use your account</li>
        <li>All app functionality associated with your account will be inaccessible</li>
        <li>Your account cannot be used for any purpose</li>
        <li>The deactivation is immediate and irreversible without contacting support</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Data Retention and Deletion Timeline</h3>

      <p>
        While your account is immediately deactivated, your data follows a specific deletion timeline to allow for
        account recovery if you change your mind:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Days 1-30:</strong> Your data is retained solely for account recovery purposes. If you contact our
          support team within this 30-day period, we can restore your account and data. During this time, your data is
          not used for any other purpose.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>After 30 days:</strong> All your data is <strong>permanently and irrevocably deleted</strong> from
          our systems. This includes your personal information, flight logs, lesson history, and all account details.
          Account recovery will no longer be possible.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        <strong>Important:</strong> This 30-day data retention period is provided solely to enable account recovery and
        complies with our legitimate interest in preventing accidental data loss. After 30 days, the deletion is final
        and cannot be undone.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention Policy</h2>

      <p>Our data retention practices for deleted accounts:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>During the 30-day grace period:</strong> Your data is retained in our systems solely to allow account recovery
          if you request it. The data is not used for any other purpose.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>After 30 days:</strong> All personal data, including email address, flight logs, lesson records, instructor
          information, and any other account-related data is permanently deleted from our databases.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        This is true account deletion, not temporary deactivation or account freezing. Once deleted, your account is
        removed from our active systems immediately.
      </p>

      <h2>Before You Delete</h2>

      <p>Please consider the following before deleting your account:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Make sure you have exported or saved any flight logs or data you wish to keep</li>
        <li>Inform any instructors or flight schools you work with about your account deletion</li>
        <li>Cancel any active subscriptions or bookings</li>
        <li>Remember that after 30 days, all data will be permanently lost</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Need Help?</h2>

      <p>
        If you have questions about account deletion, need assistance with the deletion process, or wish to recover your
        account within the 30-day grace period, please contact us:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:yannick.lagger@flightbook.ch">yannick.lagger@flightbook.ch</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p>Our support team will respond to your inquiry as quickly as possible.</p>

      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

      <p>
        For more information about how we handle your data, please review our <a href="/privacy-policy"
          >Privacy Policy</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
